<title>USA: Irvine Apartment CFO resigns.</title>
<headline>Irvine Apartment CFO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT BEACH, Calif. 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irvine Apartment Communities said on Tuesday that Richard Moran Jr. has resigned as executive vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Moran has served in those positions since the company was formed in December 1993, Irvine Apartment said.</p>
<p>Following a nearly 20-year affiliation with The Irvine Co and Irvine Apartment, Moran is leaving to pursue other professional and personal interests, the company said. Moran will remain available to the company on a consulting basis through the end of the year, Irvine Apartment said.</p>
</text>
